==============================================================================
VERDICT
==============================================================================
  positive control (person, CVD)  : FAIL  (3.01 sigma, empty room 4.12)
  same pipeline, MTI level        : 13.6 sigma -- the person IS in the file
  CVD estimator sensitivity       : detects a synthetic rotor at 140 uV pk
  fan ON vs fan OFF, max |t|      : 4.75 sigma at 127.76 Hz over 962 bins
  fan run0 vs run1 (same cond.)   : 4.69 sigma  <-- the honest floor
  fan-line repeatability corr     : +0.342
  FMCW MTI on the fan             : best -0.87 dB, 2.4 sigma
  => NO FAN DETECTION. The two same-condition controls scatter as widely as
     the fan-vs-empty comparison, so the fan is not distinguishable from a
     repeat capture of the empty room.
